6=6497a5901e6fa898524821007f053d8c7396cd4d72d12ee647379d8bfa3dacf1 and test SHA256=ea1c94fac4d7f5a5c459116978ec03ab6d06612faa4eacdc6f83d873ac2a0403 remained unchanged. Inspected actual parent proof calls and recorded StrongConvexFirstOrder SHA256=d9b0295b38b0b2259c844f86052b8ff9f2acad49a03c7dfc86708568022f4c68 and Integrability SHA256=21218e636e5c0a1474b3809f246ab168d4cf0d3ff888a3b90496f9d512c5cc6f. Fresh raw review-packet SHA256=ace406308b4b229d2d17cfb9973d0bb8feeaeab2e4c43f4549a816433d0095cd. Independently recomputed canonical packet SHA256 after removing only top-level packet_sha256 and serializing recursively ordinal-sorted compact JSON as UTF-8: 0e0f9011d7eefaab65b39846b7a887a6832ff75bef7ef0df049b9e6d80b48b0f. Verified pinned source-text SHA256=406a0387eb9afa716941b3dc147c49dd4fd4fc1360d0268e07ed16ddf4d21e19; statement SHA256=ea2cc2043e44327d5b545384c97af6e2a10fe024cfd83bc815eb3b4d5f5510a9; reconstruction SHA256=e574d67f31ccf8f37f7dc3cc1ee8ed3cecd85bece2aa035c4a7138330f074cd5; embedded module hash matches the directly checked module. publication_binding_sha256=9bdd183cb8f65e5ed78603cdc13300a24e840ff4fdd5adb769731413da321ec2 is retained as pinned full-payload metadata, not a hash recomputed from the projected candidate context. Formalizer rgo_closure_worker and anonymous decoder heatbath_exposition_research are distinct from this reviewer. The fresh packet contains no earlier semantic slots, deltas, verdicts or repairs, and none was consulted for this result. No shared registry, production theorem or test file was changed; no aggregate build or Git operation was run. Only this independent review-result artifact is persisted."
